# ITER backend settings, for running the backend on your own computer.
# Copy this file to ".env" (same folder) and fill in the values.
# The real .env file is ignored by Git and must never be committed or shared.
#
# On the live site these are NOT read from a file: add the same names and values in
# Vercel -> your project -> Settings -> Environment Variables.

# Anthropic API key used for receipt scanning and menu translation.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com -> API keys. It lives ONLY on the server.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Supabase stores the daily exchange rates. Without these two the backend still works: it simply
# asks Frankfurter for rates each time instead of once a day.
# Supabase -> your project -> Settings -> API: copy the Project URL and the SECRET key
# (called "service_role" in older projects). The secret key is server-side only, like the one above.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
